.TH DENDRO 1 "2026-11-26" "Dendro" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dendro \- Fedora DNF5 daemon package manager and dependency inspector
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dendro
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIFILE\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dendro
is an unprivileged PyQt6 graphical package manager and dependency hierarchy
explorer for Fedora Linux.
It inspects installed RPM metadata through librpm/rpm, inspects rpm-ostree
deployments read-only on Fedora Atomic hosts, resolves and executes RPM package
transactions through Fedora's DNF5 system daemon
(\fBorg.rpm.dnf.v0\fR / \fBdnf5daemon-server\fR) using Polkit authorization,
and provides a separate window for Flatpak applications and runtimes.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show command-line usage help and exit.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Print the release version and embedded source provenance, then exit.
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-debug
Enable verbose diagnostic logs on standard error, including Qt platform and
Wayland client-side decoration logging.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I FILE
Optional path to a local \fI.rpm\fR package file to inspect and install.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DENDRO_LOCALE_DIR
Override the directory containing Dendro JSON translation catalogs.
.TP
.B DENDRO_DEBUG
When set to a truthy value, enable diagnostic logging identically to
.BR \-\-debug .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/dendro/locales/
Installed Dendro interface translation catalogs.
.TP
.I /usr/share/polkit-1/actions/org.dendro.policy
Polkit action policy for the constrained HTTPS repository configuration helper.
.TP
.I /usr/libexec/dendro-repo-helper
Constrained Polkit helper that adds or removes validated \fI.repo\fR files
under \fI/etc/yum.repos.d/\fR.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dnf5 (8),
.BR dnf5daemon-server (8),
.BR rpm (8),
.BR flatpak (1)
